      "kind": "accordion",
      "source": ":::accordion\n## First section\nFirst **bold** paragraph.\nAnother line.\n\n## Second section\nAn _italic_ paragraph.\n:::",
      "html": "\n<div class=\"telar-widget telar-widget-accordion\">\n  <div class=\"accordion\" id=\"accordion-widget-1\">\n    \n    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n      <h3 class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"heading-widget-1-1\">\n        <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                data-bs-target=\"#collapse-widget-1-1\"\n                aria-expanded=\"false\"\n                aria-controls=\"collapse-widget-1-1\">\n          First section\n        </button>\n      </h3>\n      <div id=\"collapse-widget-1-1\"\n           class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n           aria-labelledby=\"heading-widget-1-1\"\n           data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-widget-1\">\n        <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n          <p>First <strong>bold</strong> paragraph.<br />\nAnother line.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n      <h3 class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"heading-widget-1-2\">\n        <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n                data-bs-target=\"#collapse-widget-1-2\"\n                aria-expanded=\"false\"\n                aria-controls=\"collapse-widget-1-2\">\n          Second section\n        </button>\n      </h3>\n      <div id=\"collapse-widget-1-2\"\n           class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n           aria-labelledby=\"heading-widget-1-2\"\n           data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-widget-1\">\n        <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n          <p>An <em>italic</em> paragraph.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>",
      "warnings": []
    },
